      "tr": "Döngü `while lo <= hi:`; içinde `mid = (lo + hi) // 2`.",
      "en": "The loop is `while lo <= hi:`; inside it `mid = (lo + hi) // 2`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Üç durum: eşitse `return mid`; `items[mid] < target` ise `lo = mid + 1`; değilse `hi = mid - 1`.",
      "en": "Three cases: if equal, `return mid`; if `items[mid] < target`, `lo = mid + 1`; otherwise `hi = mid - 1`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\ndef binary_search(items, target):\n    lo, hi = 0, len(items) - 1\n    while lo <= hi:\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n        if items[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif items[mid] < target:\n            lo = mid + 1\n        else:\n            hi = mid - 1\n    return -1\n\n\ndata = [3, 9, 14, 20, 27, 31, 40]\nprint(binary_search(data, 27))\nprint(binary_search(data, 3))\nprint(binary_search(data, 15))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef binary_search(items, target):\n    lo, hi = 0, len(items) - 1\n    while lo <= hi:\n        mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n        if items[mid] == target:\n            return mid\n        elif items[mid] < target:\n            lo = mid + 1\n        else:\n            hi = mid - 1\n    return -1\n\n\ndata = [3, 9, 14, 20, 27, 31, 40]\nprint(binary_search(data, 27))\nprint(binary_search(data, 3))\nprint(binary_search(data, 15))\n```"
    }
  ],
